### Iteration 6 — Performance Optimization
```js
// 🏁 Sprint 6  ─────────────────────────────────────────────
// Debounce expensive resize handler to improve FPS.
//
function debounce(fn, delay) {
  let id;
  return (...args) => {
    clearTimeout(id);
    id = setTimeout(() => fn(...args), delay);
  };
}

window.addEventListener('resize', debounce(() => {
  // costly layout recalculation…
  console.log('resized at', Date.now());
}, 200));
```
*Sprint Review metrics:* Chrome DevTools showed layout thrashing eliminated; **Core Web Vitals CLS** < 0.1.

